  "details": "I suggest adding a feature that lets users manually limit their microphone's audible range, similar to how the Earmuff system works for incoming voices. With this \"Private Chat Mode,\" users could reduce their microphone range so only people very close to them (e.g., within 1–2 meters) can hear them. This would allow for private conversations in public spaces, help avoid disturbing others in crowded areas, and create more immersive, proximity-based interactions. The feature could be a simple toggle or slider in the microphone settings or quick menu, with a visible indicator when active. This would give users more privacy and help reduce unwanted noise in social environments.",
